    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i'm just so busy with work and going to the doctor right now is a huge hassle. if i just watch it closely and use extra neosporin and maybe some more peroxide to make sure it's sterile, is there really that much of a chance it'll turn into something serious? like, if it doesn't start swelling or hurting more in the next 24 hours, can i consider it fine?",
